  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "嗨，這位訓練家，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我一個忙吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55E8FF0C90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B62114E00500B5FD95427FF1F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想找個人幫我把這封信\n交給艾特瓦魯學校的校長。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3627E500B4EBA5E6B6211628A90195C014FE1000A4EA47D66827E727974E69B6F5B786821768468219577300200100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我這邊出了點小問題，\n搞得沒辦法自己送過去。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62119019908A51FA4E869EDE5C0F554F984CFF0C000A641E5F976C928FA66CD581EA5DF19001904E53BB300200100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就幫個忙，\n把信送過去好不好？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C315E6B500B5FD9FF0C000A628A4FE19001904E53BB597D4E0D597DFF1F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "交給我吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EA47D66621154270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我覺得事有蹊蹺",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189BA5F974E8B67098E4A8E7A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果好奇的話，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就乾脆答應我，\n然後親自確認一下如何？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C597D594776848A71FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C314E7E81067B5461C96211FF0C000A71365F8C89AA81EA78BA8A8D4E004E0B59824F55FF1F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多謝啦～！我看<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的面相，\n就像是個願意幫忙的人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A8B1D5566FF5EFF016211770B00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684976276F8FF0C000A5C3150CF662F500B9858610F5E6B5FD976844EBA300200100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的就是這封信。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B376845C31662F90195C014FE1300200100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "收信人是<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>艾特瓦魯學校<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的校長，\n別忘了喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65364FE14EBA662F00100002FF000006827E727974E69B6F5B78682100100002FF000000768468219577FF0C000A52255FD84E865594FF0100100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀，是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳之前幫我找到了戒指。\n我真的很感激。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0C662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B32026202600100001BE01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E4B524D5E6B6211627E52304E86621263073002000A6211771F76845F88611F6FC0300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳今天來到艾特瓦魯學校，\n是有什麼事嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B34ECA59294F865230827E727974E69B6F5B786821FF0C000A662F67094EC09EBC4E8B55CEFF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要找校長",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981627E682195770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是來送信的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4F8690014FE176840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "艾特瓦魯學校的校長是我喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "827E727974E69B6F5B786821768468219577662F62115594300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>把重要信件\n交給了惠藝！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000628A91CD89814FE14EF6000A4EA47D664E8660E085DDFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是誰把這封信交給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8AB0628A90195C014FE14EA47D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B376845462FF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不……更重要的是，\n我需要去確認一件事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D2026202666F491CD89817684662FFF0C000A62119700898153BB78BA8A8D4E004EF64E8B300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到翡綠6號街區的\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>木根工程<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>一趟嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE58ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B352307FE17DA00036865F885753407684000A00100002FF000006672868395DE57A0B00100002FF0000004E008D9F55CEFF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B6357287B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B35462300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳特地跑了這一趟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3727957308DD14E8690194E008D9F300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實我應該要獨自來確認的，\n但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳交給我的那封信實在是太奇妙了……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n讓我告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳信裡寫了什麼吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE6621161C98A728981736881EA4F8678BA8A8D7684FF0C000A4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B34EA47D666211768490A35C014FE15BE65728662F592A594759994E862026202600100001BE01000A8B936211544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B34FE188E15BEB4E864EC09EBC5427300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很抱歉我沒能把重要的事交代好，\n就這麼離開了妳。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n14年前，我把自己珍惜的戒指\n交給了某個人修理。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n他的名字叫塔拉剛，\n是木根工程的老闆。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "已經離世的丈夫竟然會寄信給我，\n怎麼可能會有這回事……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以我不敢一個人來確認。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DF27D9396E24E1676844E08592B7ADF713667035BC44FE17D666211FF0C000A600E9EBC53EF80FD67036709901956DE4E8B2026202600100001BE00000A62404EE562114E0D65624E00500B4EBA4F8678BA8A8D300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就是塔拉剛先生嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C31662F585462C9525B5148751F55CEFF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是我沒錯。\n有什麼事嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F62116C92932F3002000A67094EC09EBC4E8B55CEFF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "14年前是不是曾經有位男士\n請你幫忙修理戒指呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "003100345E74524D662F4E0D662F66FE7D9367094F4D753758EB000A8ACB4F605E6B5FD94FEE7406621263075462FF1F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "的確有這麼一回事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "768478BA670990199EBC4E0056DE4E8B300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那天為了要幫卡娜莉慶生，\n我們祖孫就去了餐廳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3592970BA4E8689815E6B53615A1C83896176751FFF0C000A6211501179565B6B5C3153BB4E8699105EF3300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "結果我們和隔壁桌的男人一拍即合，\n連卡娜莉也一起吃得可開心啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D50679C62115011548C969458C1684C768475374EBA4E0062CD53735408FF0C000A902353615A1C83894E5F4E008D7754035F9753EF958B5FC35566300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那男人知道我的工作是什麼後，\n就拜託我幫他修理戒指嵌住寶石的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A375374EBA77E59053621176845DE54F5C662F4EC09EBC5F8CFF0C000A5C3162DC8A1762115E6B4ED64FEE7406621263075D4C4F4F5BF677F37684573065B9300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他說因為那是他和太太的\n定情對戒，是他的寶貝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED68AAA56E070BA90A3662F4ED6548C592A592A7684000A5B9A60C55C0D6212FF0C662F4ED676845BF68C9D300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那個人就是我的先生。\n但後來出了意外……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3500B4EBA5C31662F621176845148751F3002000A4F465F8C4F8651FA4E86610F59162026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那真是太遺憾了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3771F662F592A907A61BE4E86300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即便如此，妳還是來到了這裡。\n真是不可思議啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734FBF59826B64FF0C59B39084662F4F8652304E86901988E13002000A771F662F4E0D53EF601D8B70554A300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，讓我付清修理的費用……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C8B9362114ED86E054FEE740676848CBB75282026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位女士，請稍等。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D597358EBFF0C8ACB7A0D7B49300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "修理費嘛……<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n就用和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的對戰來抵吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4FEE74068CBB561B202620260010000201000000FF0C000A5C317528548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B376845C0D62304F8662B55427FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會在車庫等著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳。\n有那個意思的話，就過來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670357288ECA5EAB7B49845700100003110000FF01014F6059B33002000A670990A3500B610F601D76848A71FF0C5C31904E4F865427FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n麻煩<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A9EBB716900100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我從古歷老師哪兒不只是學做麵包，\n還有在學寶可夢對戰！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這就讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來見識一下我的成果吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F9E53E46B7780015E2B54EA51524E0D53EA662F5B78505A9EB55305FF0C000A9084670957285B785BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0100100001BE00000A90195C318B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B34F86898B8B584E004E0B621176846210679C5427FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會贏的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038D0F7684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳不對戰，\n我是不會把保管的戒指還給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0D5C0D6230FF0C000A6211662F4E0D6703628A4FDD7BA176846212630790847D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B350117684300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢對戰！\n準備，開始！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59225C0D6230FF01000A6E965099FF0C958B59CBFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "龍頭地鼠，龍頭地鼠，龍頭地鼠！\n用你自豪的鑽錐給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她好看！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9F8D982D57309F20FF0C9F8D982D57309F20FF0C9F8D982D57309F20FF01000A75284F6081EA8C6A7684947D93107D6600100003110000FF01014ED65979597D770BFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果真不簡單！不過，\n龍頭地鼠和我也鍛鍊得不錯吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n畢竟之前讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫了我們不少，\n我想透過變強來報恩啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C771F4E0D7C2155AEFF014E0D904EFF0C000A9F8D982D57309F20548C62114E5F935B934A5F974E0D932F5427300200100001BE01000A75627ADF4E4B524D8B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B4E86621150114E0D5C11FF0C000A621160F3900F904E8B8A5F374F86583160695566300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位夫人，修理費我確實收下了。\n寄放在我這兒的戒指就交給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D592B4EBAFF0C4FEE74068CBB621178BA5BE665364E0B4E863002000A5BC4653E57286211901951527684621263075C314EA47D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3501156C9300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000002026202600100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>把紀念戒指交給對方了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000628A7D005FF5621263074EA47D665C0D65B94E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我家的人離開之後，\n我一直都找不到他的戒指……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但現在，我們的定情戒指又在一起了。\n我會和回憶一起珍惜它的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862115BB676844EBA96E2958B4E4B5F8CFF0C000A62114E0076F490FD627E4E0D52304ED67684621263072026202600100001BE01000A4F4673FE5728FF0C6211501176845B9A60C56212630753C857284E008D774E863002000A62116703548C56DE61B64E008D7773CD60DC5B837684300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳不只找到了我的戒指，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n連我先生的戒指也都幫我找回來了。\n我真的很感激。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0D53EA627E52304E866211768462126307FF0C00100001BE01000A902362115148751F7684621263074E5F90FD5E6B6211627E56DE4F864E863002000A6211771F76845F88611F6FC0300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寄放在我這裡的戒指終於回到家了，\n這下我也能放下一顆心囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC4653E57286211901988E17684621263077D4265BC56DE52305BB64E86FF0C000A90194E0B62114E5F80FD653E4E0B4E0098465FC356C9FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我做了一個好夢喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我夢見了送給我戒指時的年輕的他，\n而且我們聊天聊得很開心呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211505A4E864E00500B597D59225594300200100001BE01000A62115922898B4E8690017D66621162126307664276845E748F1576844ED6FF0C000A800C4E1462115011804A5929804A5F975F88958B5FC35462300200100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    }
